                <pb facs="0291" n="197" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg197"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-11-28"><hi rendition="#italic">November 28,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister for foreign affairs promises an early decision insurance cases. No
                    intimation as to result.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Uhl.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
